        "slc_895f0621439423c9740daef36a4e106bc487b8b4225198fa5a0f074c87347ed2"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions are identified by repo/project name, and commands like 'run tests in my-app' are routed to the matching session automatically without needing session IDs."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5b61714f336aa29e3a394092cfca07e54f91c3827823fca3e27e1b7dd37f3ae5",
