          "url": "https://github.com/varie-ai/workstation/blob/96d500b5cbb04cd9e6d7fe1c489b3e7224685953/README.md#L144-L146"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d23c9250fca2ef1e1d73318dce50e17cfbc13fbb38639197277f9f530528932e"
      ],
      "text": "Remote mode turns on automatically when the agent dispatches or creates a session, can be toggled manually from the top bar, and turning it off stops phone notifications."
    },
    {
