        "slc_68e5ff1667e5e7490c26b934818207c0e386730bab68070236ce470384b122b9"
      ],
      "text": "The app claims to run entirely locally with no telemetry or analytics; checkpoints, session data, and configuration live in ~/.varie/ and are not synced or uploaded."
    },
