        "slc_45981165209243e8c13456367560ee4faaa402282c0f8177bc15f3225fe69e51"
      ],
      "text": "The plugin provides work-tracking skills such as /work-resume with fuzzy matching, /work-recover for post-crash checkpoint comparison, /work-stats for token usage, and /discover-projects to scan for new repos."
    },
